                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIF ÉLECTROLUMINESCENT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">LIGHT EMITTING DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A light emitting device (100) includes a plurality of light emitting elements (120) and a light controller (130). The light emitting elements (120) are for emitting lights. The light controller (130) is disposed on the light emitting elements (120) for the lights passing through, which is switchable in a first state (SU1) and a second state (SU2). The light controller (130) collimates the lights in the first state (SU1) and diffuses the lights in the second state (SU2).</p>
            </abstract>
